            "review_title": "Review at Aqua Betty - Tiki Cocktail Garden",
            "review_text": "Mai Trương Yến Ngọc\nDa Nang, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nAmazing Place!\nAug 2023 • Friends\nI had a wonderful time at Aqua Betty. The outdoor area was so refreshing and created a perfect atmosphere for a relaxed evening. I tried their Lemongrass Ginger Shandy, and it was an amazing drink - a perfect mix of lemongrass, ginger, and a touch of citrus. The karaoke added a fun element to the overall experience.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 26, 2023",
